# KEMI domain

- Workouts, weeks, items, exercises, media, and strength tests come from `data/source` via `scripts/import_training_xlsx.py`.
- Preserve `source_sheet`, `source_cell`, and `source_url` when present.
- Units stay source-faithful. Display conversion uses `1 kg = 2.2046 lb`, then gym rounding.
- Estimated 1RM is Brzycki and must be labeled Estimated 1RM.
- Coach Tips are imported text, not generated advice.
- Session logs persist in IndexedDB and must survive refresh. Do not drop a completed set on navigation.
